<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">How do I choose the right foundation shade online?</h3>
<p>Identify your depth (fair to deep) and undertone (warm/golden, neutral, or cool). Most Pakistani skin is warm or neutral, so choose a warm/neutral base, and when torn between two shades pick the slightly deeper one. Read the shade descriptions and swatches, and match to your jaw, not your hand.</p>
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Which foundation is best for oily skin in Pakistan?</h3>
