<h2 class="wp-block-heading">What is glass skin, really?</h2>
<p>Glass skin isn't about being fair — it's about being <strong>healthy, hydrated and even</strong>. It comes from a strong skin barrier, deep hydration in layers, gentle exfoliation and — above all — daily sun protection. Genetics play a part, but the routine does the heavy lifting.</p>

<h2 class="wp-block-heading">The Korean principles that matter</h2>
<ul class="wp-block-list">
